OL,3,GNEWSAHockney Country wind turbine plans
OL,4,Arejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for six large wind turbines in
OL,7,Fthe Yorkshire Wolds have been rejected.
OL,9,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council has
OL,10,Frefused an application for the
OL,11,Fturbines, each reaching 488ft (about
OL,12,F150m) high, near Burton Agnes, over
OL,13,Fconcerns for the landscape and local
OL,14,Fresidents.
OL,16,FCarol Bliss, a local artist and
OL,17,Fcampaigner against the plans, said:
OL,18,F"We're glad that common sense has been
OL,19,Fbrought to bear."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
