OL,3,GNEWSAHockney Country wind turbine plans
OL,4,Arejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Barker, project manager for
OL,7,Fdeveloper Ridge Clean Energy, said he
OL,8,Fwas "disappointed" with the decision
OL,9,Fafter the company went "above and
OL,10,Fbeyond" to engage with communities over
OL,11,Fthe proposals.
